@CO	Records for queries/strand/bsmap.toml
@CO	queries/strand/bsmap.toml -- ZS, conversion strand then orientation within it.
@CO	Each QNAME is the call the rule must make for that record: "<original>:<aligned>",
@CO	each side forward or reverse, or "unknown". Anything after the first "/" is a label
@CO	for the reader. The test that enforces it is in src/strand_rule.rs.
